# Ragas evaluation results are saved here as timestamped CSV files.
# Format: ragas_results_<YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSz>.csv
#
# Generate results by running:
#   cd services && python eval/ragas_eval.py
#
# This directory is tracked in git (to allow the dashboard to serve results),
# but the CSV files themselves are gitignored.
# See: services/eval/README.md for full documentation.
